 "meta": {
  "retrieved": "2026-11-15 (state index and market returns re-read; CPI and Treasury yield series unchanged from 2026-11-13)",
  "method": "The house price series was downloaded as a quarterly CSV from the official FRED domain on 2026-11-15 and each annual value is the arithmetic mean of that year's four quarterly values, the same convention verified by replicating the previously committed annual values exactly. The market return columns were read from the NYU Stern (Damodaran) historical returns table on the publisher's domain on 2026-11-15 and were cross-checked against that table's own cumulative $100 columns (every row consistent). No value was typed from memory or inferred.",
  "note": "Both property series now use the SAME California state-level all-transactions index: the two metropolitan-area series were withdrawn from the published edition because the index publisher's own metadata crosswalks the placeholders to their metropolitan areas. Partial calendar years (2026 quarters) are excluded. The consumer price series ends at 2024 and the Treasury series at 2025 as before."
